# Where should we write the GIF?
Output demo.gif

# Set up a 1200x600 terminal with 46px font.
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600

# Type a command in the terminal.
Type "cat /etc/os-release"
Enter
Sleep 200ms
Enter
Type "gemma4 status"
Sleep 200ms
Enter
Type "gemma4 list-engines"
Enter

# Admire the output for a bit.
Sleep 2s
